      "updated": 1782976719294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Caplin's description on hybrid themes\nrecombines \"subunits\" of sentence and period.\nA questionable choice is that the \"subunits\"\nseems to be too specific and tailored to\npresentation and continuation.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Caplin's description on hybrid themes recombines \"subunits\" of sentence and period. A questionable choice is that the \"subunits\" seems to be too specific and tailored to presentation and continuation.\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
