      "text": "Sentence a b p1-3 cad\n<~> (Twice a + b, p1+p2+p3, cad) \n= (Twice a, p1+p2 ,None) + (b, p3, cad)\n= (a,p1,None) + (a,p2,None) + (b,p3,cad) ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sentence a b p1-3 cad\n<~> (Twice a + b, p1+p2+p3, cad) \n= (Twice a, p1+p2 ,None) + (b, p3, cad)\n= (a,p1,None) + (a,p2,None) + (b,p3,cad) ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
