      "text": "Period a b c p1-4 c\n<~> (SameStart a b c, p1+p2+p3+p4, Intermission)\n= (a+b,p1+p2,Weak) + (a+c,p3+p4,Strong)\n= (a,p1,None) + (b,p2,Weak) + (a,p3,None) + (a,p4,Strong)",
